{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36252","headline":"赠美人四首 一 · 方干","name":"赠美人四首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"直缘多艺用心劳，心路玲珑格调高。\n舞袖低徊真蛱蝶，朱唇深浅假樱桃。\n粉胸半掩疑晴雪，醉眼斜回小样刀。\n才会雨云须别去，语慙不及琵琶槽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36252.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36252","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}